{"seq":1,"slug":"vector-databases","title":"向量数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/search-infrastructure/vector-databases","wordCount":997,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"向量数据库\">向量数据库</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>向量数据库（Vector Database）是专门为高维向量数据的存储、索引和检索而设计的数据库系统，是稠密检索、RAG 系统和语义搜索的核心基础设施。与传统关系型数据库不同，向量数据库的核心操作是近似最近邻（ANN）搜索，而非精确匹配查询。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 向量数据库架构&#10;        API[API 层] --&gt; QUERY[查询引擎]&#10;        API --&gt; WRITE[写入引擎]&#10;        QUERY --&gt; INDEX[向量索引]&#10;        WRITE --&gt; INDEX&#10;        INDEX --&gt; STORAGE[持久化存储]&#10;        QUERY --&gt; FILTER[标量过滤]&#10;        FILTER --&gt; META[元数据存储]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 索引类型&#10;        INDEX --&gt; HNSW_I[HNSW]&#10;        INDEX --&gt; IVF_I[IVF-PQ]&#10;        INDEX --&gt; DISK_I[DiskANN]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 向量数据库架构\n        API[API 层] --&gt; QUERY[查询引擎]\n        API --&gt; WRITE[写入引擎]\n        QUERY --&gt; INDEX[向量索引]\n        WRITE --&gt; INDEX\n        INDEX --&gt; STORAGE[持久化存储]\n        QUERY --&gt; FILTER[标量过滤]\n        FILTER --&gt; META[元数据存储]\n    end\n    subgraph 索引类型\n        INDEX --&gt; HNSW_I[HNSW]\n        INDEX --&gt; IVF_I[IVF-PQ]\n        INDEX --&gt; DISK_I[DiskANN]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据库</th>\n<th>索引类型</th>\n<th>最大规模</th>\n<th>分布式</th>\n<th>过滤方式</th>\n<th>开源</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Milvus</td>\n<td>IVF/HNSW/DiskANN</td>\n<td>十亿级</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Pre/Post Filter</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>功能全面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Qdrant</td>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>亿级</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Payload Filter</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Rust 高性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weaviate</td>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>亿级</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>倒排过滤</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>多模态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pinecone</td>\n<td>自研</td>\n<td>十亿级</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>Metadata Filter</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>全托管</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pgvector</td>\n<td>IVFFlat/HNSW</td>\n<td>千万级</td>\n<td>依赖 PG</td>\n<td>SQL WHERE</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL 扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chroma</td>\n<td>HNSW</td>\n<td>百万级</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Metadata Filter</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>轻量嵌入式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"索引构建与管理\">索引构建与管理</h2><p>向量索引的构建是一次性的高成本操作，索引质量直接决定了检索的速度和精度。不同索引类型适合不同的规模和场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface VectorCollection {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  dimension: number;&#10;  metric: &#39;cosine&#39; | &#39;l2&#39; | &#39;ip&#39;;&#10;  indexConfig: IndexConfig;&#10;  shardCount: number;&#10;  replicaCount: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface IndexConfig {&#10;  type: &#39;hnsw&#39; | &#39;ivf_flat&#39; | &#39;ivf_pq&#39; | &#39;diskann&#39; | &#39;flat&#39;;&#10;  params: Record&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const HNSW_CONFIG: IndexConfig = {&#10;  type: &#39;hnsw&#39;,&#10;  params: {&#10;    m: 16,&#10;    efConstruction: 256,&#10;    efSearch: 128,&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;const IVF_PQ_CONFIG: IndexConfig = {&#10;  type: &#39;ivf_pq&#39;,&#10;  params: {&#10;    nlist: 4096,&#10;    nprobe: 64,&#10;    m: 96,&#10;    nbits: 8,&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;interface CollectionOperations {&#10;  createCollection(config: VectorCollection): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  insert(vectors: Float32Array[], metadata: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;[]): Promise&lt;string[]&gt;;&#10;  search(query: Float32Array, topK: number, filter?: FilterExpr): Promise&lt;SearchResult[]&gt;;&#10;  delete(ids: string[]): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  upsert(id: string, vector: Float32Array, metadata: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface SearchResult {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  score: number;&#10;  vector?: Float32Array;&#10;  metadata: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface FilterExpr {&#10;  field: string;&#10;  operator: &#39;eq&#39; | &#39;ne&#39; | &#39;gt&#39; | &#39;lt&#39; | &#39;in&#39; | &#39;range&#39;;&#10;  value: unknown;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VectorCollection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dimension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cosine'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'l2'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ip'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  indexConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IndexConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  shardCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><s